80	## Key Concepts
81	
82	### File-Based Routing (TanStack Router)
83	
84	Routes are defined by files in `src/routes/`:
85	
86	- `__root.tsx` - Root layout wrapping all pages
87	- `index.tsx` - Route for `/`
88	- `api.*.ts` - Server API endpoints (e.g., `api.resume-chat.ts` → `/api/resume-chat`)
89	
90	### Component Architecture
91	
92	**UI Primitives** (`src/components/ui/`):
93	- Radix UI-based, Tailwind-styled
94	- Card, Badge, Checkbox, Separator, HoverCard
95	
96	**Feature Components** (`src/components/`):
97	- Header, HeaderNav, ResumeAssistant
