129	### TypeScript
130	- Strict mode enabled
131	- Import paths use `@/` alias
132	- Zod for runtime validation
133	- Type-only imports with `type` keyword
134	
135	### State Management
136	- React hooks for local state
137	- Zustand if you need it for global state
138	### Portfolio Integration
139	
140	Developer portfolio with Content Collections (jobs, education, blog, projects) and ResumeAssistant.
141	
142	**Content Collections:**
143	- `jobs` - jobTitle, company, startDate, endDate, location, tags, content
144	- `education` - school, summary, startDate, endDate, tags, content
145	- `blog` - title, date, summary, tags, author, content
146	- `projects` - title, description, tags, github, liveUrl, image, content
147	
148	**AI tools available (ResumeAssistant):**
149	- `getJobsBySkill` - Query jobs by skill tag
150	- `getAllJobs` - Get all work experience
151	- `getAllEducation` - Get education history
152	- `searchExperience` - Full-text search across resume
153	
154	**Routes:** /, /resume, /projects, /contact, /blog/$slug
