160	## Application Name
161	
162	This starter uses "Application Name" as a placeholder throughout the UI and metadata. Replace it with the user's desired application name in the following locations:
163	
164	### UI Components
165	- `src/components/Header.tsx` — app name displayed in the header
166	- `src/components/HeaderNav.tsx` — app name in the mobile navigation header
167	
168	### SEO Metadata
169	- `src/routes/__root.tsx` — the `title` field in the `head()` configuration
170	
171	Search for all occurrences of "Application Name" in the `src/` directory and replace with the user's application name.
